00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:53.480
no kickbacks.

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.360
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.480
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.800
